rLOg","name":"Muriel's Jackson Square","shared_categories":"Cajun/Creole, Restaurants","shared_category_count":2},{"business_id":"kdqoDMuvyNedsouc1i33vQ","name":"Araña Taqueria y Cantina","shared_categories":"Restaurants","shared_category_count":1},{"business_id":"8KnMSrMuTI2AtHZ2LOI8OQ","name":"Maurepas Foods","shared_categories":"Restaurants","shared_category_count":1},{"business_id":"JhpRI9m71ybWHkAqRdL0Tg","name":"The Avenue Pub","shared_categories":"Restaurants","shared_category_count":1},{"business_id":"_Bi9kN_eR75G1eqIl7S3pA","name":"The Bulldog","shared_categories":"Restaurants","shared_category_count":1},{"business_id":"AU-B663F3MPO7W-goWwwXA","name":"B Mac's","shared_categories":"","shared_category_count":0},{"business_id":"pKykk7lnD6Tf9wSzJYRyJA","name":"Starbucks","shared_categories":"","shared_category_count":0}],"text":[{"business_id":"KZe5kpIHWVuJl6WgNYzceg","review_id":"tMERjifxW2gKIK-xAhIVAA","date":"2017-11-26T22:51:18","stars":4,"text_representativeness":0.9376392364501953,"text_excerpt":"Great, classic diner. They do a hearty breakfast at a fair price, and the servers are charming too. Glad I decided to stop in. I ordered the vegetable omelette with added jalapeno, side of hash browns, and toast. Everything was done fine. The omelette was extra spicy, just the way I like it, and the potatoes were well seasoned. Portions were so generous that I boxed some to bring home. I was never left without water and the check was brought before I was finished. Can't complain. They also deliver, which is something I'll remember when I relocate to Nola."},{"business_id":"KZe5kpIHWVuJl6WgNYzceg","review_id":"bwIhqZNPRnIzofPDw6CZgQ","date":"2014-06-18T14:11:21","stars":4,"text_representativeness":0.9310500621795654,"text_excerpt":"Please U pleased us so much we ate here THREE times during our New Orleans vacation. It's simple, cheap, and delicious. I think perhaps people should understand the terms \"diner\" and \"greasy spoon\" before walking in, and understand that is exactly what they're going to get at Please U. The biscuits are the bomb-dot-com especially with sausage gravy ladled atop. I was cheating on my mostly veggie diet while on vacation, so I tried most of their choices for sausage and let me tell you, the links are the way to go without a doubt. The cooks know how to prepare eggs to your liking, the grits are creamy and delicious, and the coffee is piping hot. Our waitress was a hoot. In fact, she's one of..."},{"business_id":"KZe5kpIHWVuJl6WgNYzceg","review_id":"SjwqHIHlFELrLMXlZyWJ1g","date":"2016-04-02T01:00:29","stars":5,"text_representativeness":0.9291262626647949,"text_excerpt":"The waitresses and cooks at this place are super nice. The food is really good and it is reasonable. It is straightforward breakfast that will be good every time you order it. I am giving it five stars because we ate there every day during our stay here in New Orleans. The establishment is nothing that is fancy, it is a dive breakfast joint. We would save money by going here to have a really good breakfast and then splurge during our lunch or dinner's in the French Quarter. I wouldn't travel across town to eat here but if you're staying nearby then you should eat here daily."}],"visual":[{"business_id":"KZe5kpIHWVuJl6WgNYzceg","photo_id":"_OrBpBmM1sVBv4urufFmyw","label":"outside","image_url":"/photos/_OrBpBmM1sVBv4urufFmyw.jpg","visual_representativeness":0.8955142498016357},{"business_id":"KZe5kpIHWVuJl6WgNYzceg","photo_id":"-mQaWsUMXmdSyUeYoStPMw","label":"food","image_url":"/photos/-mQaWsUMXmdSyUeYoStPMw.jpg","visual_representativeness":0.8218811750411987},{"business_id":"KZe5kpIHWVuJl6WgNYzceg","photo_id":"4dSSOB-ah17DS7NZwHr1dQ","label":"food","image_url":"/photos/4dSSOB-ah17DS7NZwHr1dQ.jpg","visual_representativeness":0.8218811750411987},{"business_id":"KZe5kpIHWVuJl6WgNYzceg","photo_id":"Fz7jL8lq0_ldpVf2SyApCA","label":"food","image_url":"/photos/Fz7jL8lq0_ldpVf2SyApCA.jpg","visual_representativeness":0.7986505031585693},{"